{"kind": "mod", "id": 2567, "name": "CloudSix - Volumetric Clouds", "slug": "cloudsix-volumetric-clouds", "teaser": "Replaces Tarkov's clouds with volumetric clouds using a custom shader built from the ground up", "owner_name": "matsix", "downloads": 16589, "favourites": 41, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.matsix.cloudsix", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T08:32:11.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-01-29T06:35:10.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-03-29T04:11:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "4.0.13", "latest_version": "3.0.5", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p><strong>CloudSix</strong></p>\n<p>This is a total replacement of Tarkov’s built in clouds.</p>\n<p>Support my work on Ko-fi: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/matsix\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/matsix</a></p>\n<p>After over analyzing my clouds in VR, I wrote a custom over engineered volumetric cloud shader that works in VR and flatscreen.</p>\n<p>These clouds wouldn’t have been possible without the paper from Guerrilla Games on how they did the clouds in Horizon Zero Dawn - <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.guerrilla-games.com/read/the-real-time-volumetric-cloudscapes-of-horizon-zero-dawn\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.guerrilla-games.com/read/the-real-time-volumetric-cloudscapes-of-horizon-zero-dawn</a></p>\n<p>My main focus with these clouds was keeping them visually stable and very optimized because I wanted them to work well in VR too. They could still use some improving, a lot of improving can be done just with the values I locked behind in advanced settings. You can also increase the primary steps/light steps higher by going into advanced. By default, this runs at half res, 64 primary steps on clouds and 6 light steps. I don’t believe there’s a big performance impact here unless you’re on older hardware.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Weather affects density</li>\n<li>Wind affects cloud speed</li>\n<li>Physically based volumetrics aware of sun/moon position</li>\n<li>Procedural coloring based on Tarkov’s atmospherics</li>\n<li>Well optimized - it performs well in VR also</li>\n<li>Ground shadows based on cloud position</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Pictures:\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/a/Z1Nh2P1\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://imgur.com/a/Z1Nh2P1</a></p>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"9V9tFikvMuY\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/9V9tFikvMuY?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9V9tFikvMuY/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.11", "content_length": 1836991, "downloads": 260, "published_at": "2026-01-29T06:37:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2567/cloudsix-volumetric-clouds/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.11", "content_length": 1836927, "downloads": 149, "published_at": "2026-01-29T15:37:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2567/cloudsix-volumetric-clouds/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.11", "content_length": 1836623, "downloads": 203, "published_at": "2026-01-29T18:23:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2567/cloudsix-volumetric-clouds/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": []}, {